{"parse": {"title": "打虎记-04", "pageid": 134668, "text": "<div class=\"mw-parser-output\"><div class=\"tabber no-indent\"><div class=\"episode-inter-nav\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%89%93%E8%99%8E%E8%AE%B0-03\" title=\"打虎记-03\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a><span class=\"nav-page-name\">打虎记-04</span><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%89%93%E8%99%8E%E8%AE%B0-05\" title=\"打虎记-05\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" class=\"img-rotate\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a></div><div class=\"episode-panel\"><div style=\"position: relative; padding-left: 35px;\"><div class=\"episode-deco\"><div class=\"episode-deco-1\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-2\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-3\"></div></div><div class=\"episode-index\"><span class=\"episode-index-chapter\">打虎记</span><span class=\"episode-index-number\">04</span></div><h2 style=\"position:absolute; opacity:0; pointer-events:none;width:0; height:0; overflow:hidden;\"><span id=\".E7.A2.8E.E7.8E.89\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"碎玉\">碎玉</span></h2><div class=\"episode-title\"> 碎玉</div><div class=\"episode-subtitle\">The Silver Thread</div></div><div><div class=\"episode-navbar\"><div class=\"tabber-filter auto-first\" style=\"display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; margin: 0 -4px;\"></div></div></div></div><div class=\"episode-switchbtn\"><small style=\"color: #999;\">头像 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small> <small style=\"color: #999;\">背景图 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small></div><div class=\"episode-desc\"><div style=\"display:flex;\"><div style=\"flex-grow:1;\"></div></div></div><div class=\"battle-panel\"><div class=\"story no-indent\"><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-3_4_bg_05.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"3_4_bg_05\"><img alt=\"3_4_bg_05\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5b/Cg-3_4_bg_05.png/600px-Cg-3_4_bg_05.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5b/Cg-3_4_bg_05.png/900px-Cg-3_4_bg_05.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5b/Cg-3_4_bg_05.png/1200px-Cg-3_4_bg_05.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"647201.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e1/HeadIconSmall-647201.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-647201.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"647201.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e1/HeadIconSmall-647201.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-647201.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e1/HeadIconSmall-647201.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-647201.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">秀郎中：</div><div>把台上那碗药挪到我手里——用神秘术。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">程和光：</div><div>为何？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">秀郎中：</div><div>贤侄啊，怎么总是和长辈顶嘴呢？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">程和光：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">秀郎中：</div><div>熬药端药，也算是医馆的活计。你要是想白躺几天，那也随你！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>程和光沉默片刻，伸出右手，对准那药碗。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">程和光：</div><div>唔……呃……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>药碗瞬间变了黑色，几乎是飞旋着撞进了秀郎中的手心。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">秀郎中：</div><div>嗯……距离正常，但力度太大。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">秀郎中：</div><div>怎么这么重，我看看……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">秀郎中：</div><div>哈哈哈哈哈哈哈！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她忽然爆发出一阵愉快的大笑，随后把铁碗竖立起来，展示给程和光看。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>原来药汤也被一起变为了金属，成了实打实的铁块。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">秀郎中：</div><div>幸好这术法一炷香便能恢复原状，不然你可要赔我一碗药。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">秀郎中：</div><div>你稍等等吧。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"644402.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fb/HeadIconSmall-644402.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-644402.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"644402.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fb/HeadIconSmall-644402.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-644402.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fb/HeadIconSmall-644402.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-644402.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">老年人：</div><div>呃啊！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">程和光：</div><div>……我许久未用了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">程和光：</div><div>只要多练习几次，定可以完美使出。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>秀郎中四处转了几圈，不知从哪里收拾出一堆缺口的破碗。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">秀郎中：</div><div>先用这些东西练吧。练好了这些，更轻的花叶不在话下。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">秀郎中：</div><div>“锐意”与我的神秘术类似，无非是个绣花的技巧。细细理好你感受到的气，对准那东西——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">秀郎中：</div><div>然后刺下。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-3_4_bg_06.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"3_4_bg_06\"><img alt=\"3_4_bg_06\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/68/Cg-3_4_bg_06.png/600px-Cg-3_4_bg_06.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/68/Cg-3_4_bg_06.png/900px-Cg-3_4_bg_06.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/68/Cg-3_4_bg_06.png/1200px-Cg-3_4_bg_06.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"313720.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c9/HeadIconSmall-313720.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-313720.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"313720.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c9/HeadIconSmall-313720.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-313720.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c9/HeadIconSmall-313720.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-313720.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">程和光：</div><div>哈！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>铁碗又一次砸在了白墙上，程和光的眉头拧得更深了些。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"623402.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/88/HeadIconSmall-623402.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-623402.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"623402.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/88/HeadIconSmall-623402.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-623402.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/88/HeadIconSmall-623402.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-623402.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">猎户：</div><div>小哥，我看你天天在摔这个破碗。也不知道秀郎中为何要你做这个？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>之前被虎咬伤的猎户已经苏醒。他闲来无事，主动和程和光攀谈起来。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">程和光：</div><div>是训练我神秘术的方法。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>另外两个躺在床上的病人，也忍不住加入了对话。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"644402.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fb/HeadIconSmall-644402.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-644402.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"644402.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fb/HeadIconSmall-644402.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-644402.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fb/HeadIconSmall-644402.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-644402.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">老年人：</div><div>训练？她一个不会拳脚的老婆婆，竟当起教头来了！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">程和光：</div><div>不会拳脚？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"622602.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f0/HeadIconSmall-622602.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-622602.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"622602.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f0/HeadIconSmall-622602.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-622602.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f0/HeadIconSmall-622602.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-622602.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">青年人：</div><div>哈哈，你是不是也被她吓住了！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"622602.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f0/HeadIconSmall-622602.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-622602.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"622602.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f0/HeadIconSmall-622602.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-622602.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f0/HeadIconSmall-622602.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-622602.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">青年人：</div><div>秀郎中是长得凶了点，脾气臭了些，说话声音大了些——可从没见过她和人打过架。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"644402.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fb/HeadIconSmall-644402.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-644402.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"644402.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fb/HeadIconSmall-644402.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-644402.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fb/HeadIconSmall-644402.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-644402.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">老年人：</div><div>她那神秘术，没根头发丝粗的银线，能干什么？也就是缝缝伤口。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">程和光：</div><div>……这倒是没想到。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"623402.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/88/HeadIconSmall-623402.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-623402.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"623402.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/88/HeadIconSmall-623402.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-623402.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/88/HeadIconSmall-623402.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-623402.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">猎户：</div><div>你可别这么说！那年度朔，秀郎中不是还演了个什么娘子军，在那喊：杀！杀！可有气势了！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"622602.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f0/HeadIconSmall-622602.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-622602.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"622602.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f0/HeadIconSmall-622602.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-622602.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f0/HeadIconSmall-622602.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-622602.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">青年人：</div><div>嗨呀，喊喊谁不会？我还能演大将军呢，三军听令——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>又一个铁碗滚落在地。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">程和光：</div><div>……可我听说，涣州以前有个匪徒，也是用银线做武器。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">程和光：</div><div>劫过官粮，烧过村子，伤了不少官兵。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"644402.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fb/HeadIconSmall-644402.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-644402.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"644402.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fb/HeadIconSmall-644402.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-644402.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fb/HeadIconSmall-644402.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-644402.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">老年人：</div><div>这事我倒是听外头的商贩说过，说那银线削铁如泥，厉害得很。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"644402.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fb/HeadIconSmall-644402.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-644402.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"644402.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fb/HeadIconSmall-644402.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-644402.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fb/HeadIconSmall-644402.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-644402.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">老年人：</div><div>最后是进了祝县抢劫不是？之后就没听说了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"622602.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f0/HeadIconSmall-622602.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-622602.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"622602.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f0/HeadIconSmall-622602.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-622602.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f0/HeadIconSmall-622602.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-622602.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">青年人：</div><div>祝县！那可是涣州最富庶的县，里面住着不少商贾和高官亲戚！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"622602.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f0/HeadIconSmall-622602.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-622602.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"622602.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f0/HeadIconSmall-622602.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-622602.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f0/HeadIconSmall-622602.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-622602.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">青年人：</div><div>和咱们这穷地方不一样……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"623402.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/88/HeadIconSmall-623402.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-623402.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"623402.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/88/HeadIconSmall-623402.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-623402.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/88/HeadIconSmall-623402.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-623402.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">猎户：</div><div>你们这都是胡说！秀郎中就算会打架，也肯定是个大侠，怎么会是山贼呢？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"622602.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f0/HeadIconSmall-622602.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-622602.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"622602.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f0/HeadIconSmall-622602.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-622602.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f0/HeadIconSmall-622602.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-622602.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">青年人：</div><div>不同人也会有相似的神秘术吧，我还和胡家人一样，都能指尖打火苗呢！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"644402.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fb/HeadIconSmall-644402.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-644402.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"644402.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fb/HeadIconSmall-644402.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-644402.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fb/HeadIconSmall-644402.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-644402.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">老年人：</div><div>是啊，都没见她拿银线切过菜，估计真没啥用！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"623402.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/88/HeadIconSmall-623402.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-623402.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"623402.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/88/HeadIconSmall-623402.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-623402.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/88/HeadIconSmall-623402.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-623402.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">猎户：</div><div>你说她做过什么贼，全水乡都没人信的。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">程和光：</div><div>是吗……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"644402.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fb/HeadIconSmall-644402.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-644402.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"644402.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fb/HeadIconSmall-644402.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-644402.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fb/HeadIconSmall-644402.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-644402.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">老年人：</div><div>咱们乡以前是没医生的，小病都得忍着，大病跑到县里也交不起诊费药钱。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"644402.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fb/HeadIconSmall-644402.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-644402.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"644402.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fb/HeadIconSmall-644402.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-644402.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fb/HeadIconSmall-644402.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-644402.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">老年人：</div><div>几年前，秀郎中来了，乡里人才看得起病了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"622602.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f0/HeadIconSmall-622602.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-622602.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"622602.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f0/HeadIconSmall-622602.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-622602.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f0/HeadIconSmall-622602.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-622602.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">青年人：</div><div>就是，我儿子去年惊厥，还多亏了她救命。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"313720.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c9/HeadIconSmall-313720.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-313720.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"313720.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c9/HeadIconSmall-313720.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-313720.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c9/HeadIconSmall-313720.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-313720.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">程和光：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>铁碗缓慢升起，摇晃着飞向另一边。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>——最终平稳地落到了桌上。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"313720.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c9/HeadIconSmall-313720.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-313720.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"313720.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c9/HeadIconSmall-313720.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-313720.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c9/HeadIconSmall-313720.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-313720.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">程和光：</div><div>……！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"623402.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/88/HeadIconSmall-623402.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-623402.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"623402.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/88/HeadIconSmall-623402.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-623402.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/88/HeadIconSmall-623402.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-623402.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">猎户：</div><div>哎哟，小哥你可真厉害！可算是成了！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"644402.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fb/HeadIconSmall-644402.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-644402.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"644402.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fb/HeadIconSmall-644402.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-644402.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fb/HeadIconSmall-644402.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-644402.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">老年人：</div><div>这下可以把我的药平安拿来了！</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-3_4_bg_05.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"3_4_bg_05\"><img alt=\"3_4_bg_05\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5b/Cg-3_4_bg_05.png/600px-Cg-3_4_bg_05.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5b/Cg-3_4_bg_05.png/900px-Cg-3_4_bg_05.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5b/Cg-3_4_bg_05.png/1200px-Cg-3_4_bg_05.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">秀郎中：</div><div>哎，胡家又要我去开药！呼来喝去的，都不肯屈尊来医馆！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">秀郎中：</div><div>如果我哪天救了他们的命，非要敲诈一万两不可！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"623201.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/37/HeadIconSmall-623201.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-623201.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"623201.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/37/HeadIconSmall-623201.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-623201.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/37/HeadIconSmall-623201.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-623201.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">伙计：</div><div>知道了，你去吧。医馆有我看着。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>秀郎中正欲迈过门槛，一只茶杯却忽然从侧后方飞旋砸来。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"623201.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/37/HeadIconSmall-623201.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-623201.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"623201.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/37/HeadIconSmall-623201.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-623201.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/37/HeadIconSmall-623201.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-623201.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">伙计：</div><div>大姐！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>秀郎中并不惊慌，只是对着茶杯伸出手掌。那茶杯也真就立刻停住势头，缓缓落在她手中。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>杯底的圈足变成了漂亮的金属色，杯中是泡好的清茶，茶叶已完全舒展，沉在水底。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">程和光：</div><div>如何？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">秀郎中：</div><div>三日便能如此，的确值得夸奖。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>秀郎中将茶水一饮而尽，出门离开。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-1_6_bg_guanfushinei2.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"1_6_bg_guanfushinei2\"><img alt=\"1_6_bg_guanfushinei2\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/57/Cg-1_6_bg_guanfushinei2.png/600px-Cg-1_6_bg_guanfushinei2.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/57/Cg-1_6_bg_guanfushinei2.png/900px-Cg-1_6_bg_guanfushinei2.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/57/Cg-1_6_bg_guanfushinei2.png/1200px-Cg-1_6_bg_guanfushinei2.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>时辰尚早，病人们仍在睡觉。程和光将那些破碗挪到另一间屋子，打算一并收拾了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>伙计端着一碗药汤走过来。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"623201.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/37/HeadIconSmall-623201.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-623201.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"623201.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/37/HeadIconSmall-623201.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-623201.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/37/HeadIconSmall-623201.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-623201.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">伙计：</div><div>小哥，该喝药了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">程和光：</div><div>我并无内服药物。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"623201.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/37/HeadIconSmall-623201.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-623201.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"623201.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/37/HeadIconSmall-623201.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-623201.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/37/HeadIconSmall-623201.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-623201.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">伙计：</div><div>是新开的，补气。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">程和光：</div><div>……闻起来像黄芪、当归。但我的伤已经好了，没必要浪费。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"623201.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/37/HeadIconSmall-623201.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-623201.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"623201.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/37/HeadIconSmall-623201.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-623201.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/37/HeadIconSmall-623201.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-623201.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">伙计：</div><div>损耗的气血也要补回来的，这可是郎中特意安排的。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>程和光微微皱眉，还是接过了药，举到嘴边。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>一根银线飞来，打翻了他手里的药碗。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>瓷碗发出清脆的碎裂声，棕色的药液溅了满地。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>秀郎中沉着脸站在不远处。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">秀郎中：</div><div>那不是他的药。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"623201.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/37/HeadIconSmall-623201.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-623201.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"623201.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/37/HeadIconSmall-623201.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-623201.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/37/HeadIconSmall-623201.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-623201.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">伙计：</div><div>大姐！你怎么回来了！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">秀郎中：</div><div>回来拿东西。这怎么回事？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"623201.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/37/HeadIconSmall-623201.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-623201.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"623201.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/37/HeadIconSmall-623201.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-623201.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/37/HeadIconSmall-623201.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-623201.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">伙计：</div><div>……是他别有所图。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>伙计从衣襟里掏出一张淡黄色的纸，交到秀郎中手中。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">程和光：</div><div>你翻了我的包裹？！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"623201.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/37/HeadIconSmall-623201.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-623201.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"623201.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/37/HeadIconSmall-623201.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-623201.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/37/HeadIconSmall-623201.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-623201.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">伙计：</div><div>寻常人怎么会在医馆打听什么贼匪？藏得还挺严实，叫我好找！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"647203.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/bb/HeadIconSmall-647203.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-647203.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"647203.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/bb/HeadIconSmall-647203.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-647203.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/bb/HeadIconSmall-647203.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-647203.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">秀郎中：</div><div>哦，我看看……“骨梭子，明火执仗，劫掠府仓。”</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"647203.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/bb/HeadIconSmall-647203.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-647203.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"647203.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/bb/HeadIconSmall-647203.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-647203.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/bb/HeadIconSmall-647203.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-647203.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">秀郎中：</div><div>“此贼凶悍，手持骨梭，擅使银线。现着诸府州县缉之，务必小心周详。”</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"647203.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/bb/HeadIconSmall-647203.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-647203.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"647203.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/bb/HeadIconSmall-647203.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-647203.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/bb/HeadIconSmall-647203.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-647203.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">秀郎中：</div><div>哈哈，这张通缉令我倒没见过。竟然把我画这么丑，这谁能认出来？还是得靠这手神秘术……是不是啊？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"313721.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5c/HeadIconSmall-313721.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-313721.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"313721.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5c/HeadIconSmall-313721.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-313721.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5c/HeadIconSmall-313721.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-313721.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">程和光：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"623201.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/37/HeadIconSmall-623201.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-623201.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"623201.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/37/HeadIconSmall-623201.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-623201.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/37/HeadIconSmall-623201.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-623201.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">伙计：</div><div>我不想牵连大姐，本想偷偷解决——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>秀郎中把通缉令对折，丢到一边的火盆里。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">秀郎中：</div><div>这是程小弟的小孩。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"623201.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/37/HeadIconSmall-623201.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-623201.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"623201.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/37/HeadIconSmall-623201.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-623201.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/37/HeadIconSmall-623201.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-623201.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">伙计：</div><div>呵，我猜到了，那神秘术……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"623201.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/37/HeadIconSmall-623201.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-623201.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"623201.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/37/HeadIconSmall-623201.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-623201.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/37/HeadIconSmall-623201.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-623201.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">伙计：</div><div>但那又如何！程道官是我们看着长大的，本来就应该帮忙！大姐没有错！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"623201.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/37/HeadIconSmall-623201.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-623201.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"623201.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/37/HeadIconSmall-623201.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-623201.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/37/HeadIconSmall-623201.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-623201.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">伙计：</div><div>我女儿都饿死了，他还在那装什么老爷，百般不情愿。说什么拿快些，拿少点，如果不是大姐——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>秀郎中猛地拍了下身旁的桌案。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">秀郎中：</div><div>够了！你进去把药熬了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">秀郎中：</div><div>去啊！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>伙计不甘地看了程和光一眼，悻悻地走了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>秀郎中忽而袖袍一挥，将那些化为金属的破碗扫落在地。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">程和光：</div><div>……！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">秀郎中：</div><div>你说你不是衙门的人。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">程和光：</div><div>我的确不是。我只是从衙门那里领了追缉的任务。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">秀郎中：</div><div>为了钱？还是什么……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">秀郎中：</div><div>为何不挑明动手，想等到养好伤再偷袭我？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">程和光：</div><div>……我在此观察多日，你的行径不像恶人。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">程和光：</div><div>通缉令也只是一张纸。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">程和光：</div><div>若你未曾纵火伤人，劫掠祝县。我这便离开。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>秀郎中深吸了一口气，表情归于平淡。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">秀郎中：</div><div>可惜我做了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">秀郎中：</div><div>你的伤是不是好了？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">秀郎中：</div><div>那就打吧。</div></div></div></div></div></div>", "categories": [{"sortkey": "", "category": "没有战斗的章节", "hidden": true}, {"sortkey": "", "category": "章节"}], "displaytitle": "打虎记-04"}}